./docs/backlog_done.md:1466:- **Symptom** — Loading an `.opus` track (the user's primary format, ~4–6 MB) stalls the UI isolate for ~1–2 s; the rest of the app plays gaplessly via `loadFile` (mp3/wav/flac) without this hitch.
./docs/backlog_done.md:1467:- **Repro** — Instrumented `_openOpusFromBytes` on the API 37 emulator (2026-06-01): the Dart-side `setBufferStream` + chunked `addAudioDataStream` feed ran on the **UI isolate**, and **78–86% of the ~300 ms/MB feed was synchronous native Opus decode inside the FFI call** (~32 ms per 128 KB chunk). The acquisition/fd angle (prior "Option A") was a measured **no-op** — with `READ_MEDIA_AUDIO` granted, raw reads succeed (`mode=direct-file`), so the cost was never I/O; it was decode-on-the-wrong-thread. Root cause: stock `flutter_soloud` `loadFile`/`loadMem` route `OggS`→stb_vorbis (Vorbis only) and reject Opus, forcing the buffer-stream workaround; the bundled Opus decoder (raw libopus+libogg) was wired only to the streaming path.
./docs/backlog_done.md:1469:- **Notes** — Fixed via a **local vendored fork** of `flutter_soloud` (`./soloud`, `dependency_overrides`; originally sourced from `maxim-saplin/flutter_soloud@opus-loadfile`). Native change confined to `src/player.{cpp,h}`: `tryLoadOpusBufferStream` sniffs `OggS`+`OpusHead`, builds a PRESERVED/AUTO `BufferStream`, feeds the whole buffer once, `setDataIsEnded()`; wired into `loadMem` and `loadFile` (cheap 512-byte sniff, full read only on Opus). No vendored-engine edits, guarded by `NO_XIPH_LIBS`. App side: `soloud_transport.dart` `_openSource` routes `.opus` through the same `loadFile`/fd/`loadMem` path as every format; deleted `_openOpusFromBytes` + `audioStreamChunks` (+ test). See memory `opus-native-loadfile-fork`.
./docs/backlog_done.md:1472:**Closed**: 2026-06-01 — verified on the API 37 emulator: opus loads `mode=loadFile`; UI jank during an opus load matches an mp3 load (`janky33` 43 vs 52; vs the old sustained UI-isolate stall), confirming the decode moved off the UI isolate; duration correct, playback + track-advance work, mp3/wav unaffected; 376 unit/widget tests green. Not separately re-tested: `<32 KB` opus flush path (no encoder on host; handled by the decoder's deferred-end-of-stream flag) and seek via driver (no `seek` ext, but same PRESERVED `BufferStream` source type as before — preserved by construction). Shipped alongside a dependency upgrade (`file_picker` 11, `package_info_plus` 9, `permission_handler` 12.0.3; `flutter clean` needed to clear a stale plugin classpath). **Pending**: upstream PR to alnitak/flutter_soloud, then drop the override.
